      "text": "$\\alpha=2, \\beta=\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{\\alpha}{|x|} \\cdot \\frac{|x|}{x}+2 \\beta x+1, f(-1)=f(2)=0$\nSo, $-\\alpha-2 \\beta+1=0 \n \\Rightarrow \\alpha+2 \\beta-1=0$ ...(i)\n$\\& \\frac{\\alpha}{2}+4 \\beta+1=0 \\Rightarrow \\alpha+8 \\beta+2=0$....(ii)\n(ii) - (i) $\\Rightarrow 6 \\beta+3=0 \\Rightarrow \\beta=-1 / 2$\n(i) $\\Rightarrow \\alpha-1-1=0 \\Rightarrow \\alpha=2$",
    "image": null
  },
